    <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-412" contextRef="c-02">&lt;p&gt;As of December 31, 2025, LS Power Grid New York Corporation I was controlled by its sole shareholder LS Power Grid New York Holdings, LLC, which was controlled by its sole member LSP Transmission Holdings, LLC, which was controlled indirectly by LS Power Development, LLC as general partner of LS Power Associates, L.P.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
