    <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-468" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Darpan Kapadia appointed Executive Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shimon Edelstein removed as Executive Vice President, Tax;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Daniel Moreno removed as Controller, Generation;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lawrence Willick removed as Executive Vice President.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
