    <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-473" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;6. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Q3 2025, LS Power Grid New York Corporation I converted its $200 million term loan facility and $20 million revolving loan facility authorized in State of New York Public Service Commission Case No. 20-E-0361 into fixed rate notes totaling $220 million. Additionally, LS Power Grid New York Corporation I has the ability to draw up to $10 million on its refinanced revolving loan facility.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
