    <ferc:BasisAmortizationCharges id="f-1703" contextRef="c-02">Section A, Line 1, Column (d), represents amortization of transmission intangible assets using the rates contained in the Settlement Agreement accepted in Docket No. ER20-716: 1.43% for transmission land rights, 1.59% for interconnection costs (which is tied to underlying utility assets), and 6.67% for an intangible asset transfer. Leaseholds are amortized over the remaining life of the related lease. The 6.67% rate for software from the preceding report year is no longer used as a result of FERC Order 898. There have been no other changes from the previous year.</ferc:BasisAmortizationCharges>
