&lt;span&gt;In 2025, the Company recognized $10.7million in depreciation and amortization costs and$1.3 million in cost of removal, for a total of $12.0 million of Depreciation and amortization expense on the accompanying statement of operations.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In 2024, the Company recognized $10.4million in depreciation and amortization costs and $1.4 million in cost of removal, for a total of $11.8 million of Depreciation and amortization expense on the accompanying statement of operations.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the balance in Construction in progress is as follows (in thousands):&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 458.65pt; margin-left: 21.95pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.05pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 35.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0